{
  "duration": 81.239,
  "phrases": [
    {
      "start": 0.119,
      "end": 0.28,
      "text": "So"
    },
    {
      "start": 0.959,
      "end": 1.839,
      "text": "welcome back again."
    },
    {
      "start": 2.379,
      "end": 4.039,
      "text": "It's time to solve one more problem."
    },
    {
      "start": 4.519,
      "end": 5.259,
      "text": "Now, in this problem,"
    },
    {
      "start": 5.699,
      "end": 6.159,
      "text": "a boat"
    },
    {
      "start": 6.5,
      "end": 7.059,
      "text": "travels"
    },
    {
      "start": 7.619,
      "end": 8.319,
      "text": "twenty-four"
    },
    {
      "start": 8.92,
      "end": 9.539,
      "text": "kilometer"
    },
    {
      "start": 10.139,
      "end": 12.059,
      "text": "upstream at eight kilometers per hour"
    },
    {
      "start": 12.579,
      "end": 16.359,
      "text": "and then thirty-six kilometer downstream at twelve kilometers per hour."
    },
    {
      "start": 16.84,
      "end": 17.76,
      "text": "The question is"
    },
    {
      "start": 18.279,
      "end": 20.18,
      "text": "asking us to find the total time"
    },
    {
      "start": 20.6,
      "end": 21.979,
      "text": "taken for the whole journey."
    },
    {
      "start": 22.379,
      "end": 23.699,
      "text": "Now, the important point here is"
    },
    {
      "start": 24.18,
      "end": 26.259,
      "text": "that the journey has two different parts."
    },
    {
      "start": 26.639,
      "end": 29.42,
      "text": "One part is upstream and the other part is downstream."
    },
    {
      "start": 29.799,
      "end": 32.619,
      "text": "So we cannot calculate the total time directly."
    },
    {
      "start": 32.959,
      "end": 36.699,
      "text": "We first find the time for each part separately and then add them."
    },
    {
      "start": 37.479,
      "end": 42.239,
      "text": "Given upstream distance equals twenty-four kilometer, upstream speed equals eight kilometers per hour."
    },
    {
      "start": 42.739,
      "end": 47.379,
      "text": "Downstream distance equals thirty-six kilometer, downstream speed equals twelve kilometers per hour."
    },
    {
      "start": 48.02,
      "end": 49.459,
      "text": "Now we know the formula for time."
    },
    {
      "start": 50.02,
      "end": 52.059,
      "text": "Time equals distance divided by speed."
    },
    {
      "start": 52.5,
      "end": 54.079,
      "text": "So let us use this formula one by one."
    },
    {
      "start": 54.579,
      "end": 54.899,
      "text": "First,"
    },
    {
      "start": 55.299,
      "end": 59.559,
      "text": "the time taken upstream. Time equals twenty-four divided by eight equals three hours."
    },
    {
      "start": 59.979,
      "end": 60.239,
      "text": "Done."
    },
    {
      "start": 60.759,
      "end": 62.479,
      "text": "Now let us move to the downstream journey."
    },
    {
      "start": 62.899,
      "end": 71.239,
      "text": "Time equals thirty-six divided by twelve equals three hours. Now that both parts are clear, we simply add them because the boat completes both journeys one after the other."
    },
    {
      "start": 71.919,
      "end": 74.819,
      "text": "Total time equals three plus three equals six hours."
    },
    {
      "start": 75.699,
      "end": 78.439,
      "text": "Hence, the total time taken is six hours."
    },
    {
      "start": 78.819,
      "end": 81.239,
      "text": "So the correct option is option C."
    }
  ],
